# Production builds (the desktop app and the public site) embed no secret of any kind.
#
# The app has no AI integration: by owner ruling of 2026-09-02 the Anthropic client, its dev
# proxy, its Tauri key command and its dependency were removed from q-app permanently, and no
# replacement key will be issued. scripts/test-no-anthropic-integration.mjs fails the build if
# any of that returns. Firebase's web config stays in the VITE_ values (public by design).
